Subject: [PATCH] pam_systemd: allow disabling OSC context for serial consoles

Serial terminals such as minicom may print OSC 3008 payloads literally.
Allow serial-getty services to opt out without changing TERM or disabling
PAM session registration.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [BSP serial-console policy]

--- a/src/login/pam_systemd.c
+++ b/src/login/pam_systemd.c
@@ -1625,2 +1625,7 @@
         assert(ur);
 
+        /* Serial terminal emulators may not understand OSC 3008. Allow the
+         * getty service to suppress metadata without changing TERM. */
+        if (!getenv_harder_bool(handle, "SYSTEMD_OSC_CONTEXT", true))
+                return PAM_SUCCESS;
+
